{{#if project_type_requirements}}

<h2>web_app Specific Requirements</h2>

As a modern web application, the following architectural and design principles will be adopted:
- **Single Page Application (SPA):** The application will be a SPA to provide a fluid and responsive user experience, with fast transitions between different views.
- **Browser Support:** The application will support the latest versions of major browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge).
- **SEO:** While not a primary concern for a logged-in application, basic SEO principles will be applied to the marketing/landing page.
- **Real-time Updates:** The simulation will feature real-time updates to the Gantt chart and dashboards, likely using WebSockets or similar technology.
- **Accessibility:** The application will adhere to WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility standards to ensure it is usable by people with disabilities.

